<div class="flex-1 z-1 justify-self-start max-w-full break-words text-start self-start justify-start leading-snug">ADAmail</div></h3><p class="has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start">ADAmail is a unique tool developed by IAMX and NMKR that combines traditional email with Web3 utilities. It allows users to send emails to every Cardano Wallet and log into their email account by connecting their wallet.</p><div class="decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full print:break-inside-avoid relative overflow-hidden after:block after:absolute after:-inset-0 rounded-corners:rounded-sm circular-corners:rounded-2xl after:border-tint-subtle after:border after:rounded circular-corners:after:rounded-2xl rounded-corners:after:rounded-sm dark:after:mix-blend-plus-lighter after:pointer-events-none"><a class="group flex flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 ring-1 ring-tint-subtle rounded-sm straight-corners:rounded-none circular-corners:rounded-2xl px-5 py-3 transition-shadow hover:ring-primary-hover" href="https://www.adamail.me/"><span class="flex flex-col flex-1"><span class="text-base transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">https://www.adamail.me/</span><span class="text-base">www.adamail.me</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-3 text-tint transition-all group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-primary"><path fill="currentColor" d="M313.5 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-200 200c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0s-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l183-183-183-183c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l200 200z"/></svg></a></div><h3 id="el-paso-verse-still-in-development" class="text-lg @xs:text-xl @lg:text-2xl font-semibold heading pdf-heading flex items-baseline scroll-mt-(--content-scroll-margin) text-start self-start justify-start 